OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft scrambles to solve
OL,4,Aglobal outage affecting tens of
OL,5,Athousands but says fixes not going 'as
OL,6,Aexpected'
OL,7,
OL,8,FA Microsoft outage is continuing to
OL,9,Faffect users in at least 74 countries
OL,10,Faround the world - here's what we know
OL,12,FServices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,13,FAI software Copilot have been hit with
OL,14,Fconnectivity problems for more than 10
OL,15,Fhours
OL,17,FReports of issues with Outlook alone
OL,18,Fpeaked globally at about 140,000 on
OL,19,FThursday, according to monitoring
OL,20,Fwebsite Downdetector - this went down
OL,21,Fto 28,000 overnight
